  "next_authorization_statement": "I approve one bounded CPU-only BigCodeBench v0.1.4 prompt-signature acquisition at Hugging Face revision b74c0d0bf70d2c0bc459be537895cca163007f1a, limited to exact object data/v0.1.4-00000-of-00001.parquet (2,362,110 bytes; SHA-256 d9a4965821c9507ebdfb551c288656b2d5fe553234f5183044333ca8a4018267), maximum 4 MiB network / 32 MiB decoded / 60 minutes. It may read only task_id, complete_prompt, instruct_prompt, and code_prompt, create at most 3,420 private prompt signatures, and build a raw-text-free candidate successor preserving all 46,999 existing registry entries. It must not retain or hash canonical_solution, test, doc_struct, entry_point, or libs. No external API, GPU, active-registry mutation, candidate-source promotion, dataset seal, SFT training, LiveCodeBench data, unrelated data, or external distribution.",
